OL,3,GNEWSACemetery traffic leaves residents
OL,4,Atrapped in homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraffic congestion near a cemetery has
OL,7,Fleft roads gridlocked and people unable
OL,8,Fto leave or access their homes,
OL,9,Fresidents said.
OL,11,FVideos seen by the BBC show vehicles on
OL,12,FLindridge Road in Sutton Coldfield,
OL,13,FWest Midlands, parked on grass verges
OL,14,Fand pavements, alongside long queues of
OL,15,Fstationary traffic on the road.
OL,17,FSusan Ashley, who has lived opposite
OL,18,FNew Hall Cemetery for more than 50
OL,19,Fyears, said: "You're scared to leave
OL,20,Fyour home in case you can't get back."
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
